<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera lowered by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera lowered by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded its near-term rating on Altera Corp to neutral from outperform, keeping a long-term outperform rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- on Wednesday, the semiconductor maker said it expects only low-to-mid single digit sequential revenue growth in its September quarter due to the aggressive price reductions it announced at the end of June.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off two at 56-5/8.</p>
</text>
